WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.560 --> 00:00:08.980
Sophie. Yes Finn? Our topic for the day: Describe your daily routine... Ok, great.

00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:19.650
using lots and lots of adverbs... lots of adverbs, got it...great.  So I usually wake up
around 7 am. Me too:  breakfast?

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:22.880
Yeah, I'll try and have breakfast.

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:30.790
sometimes I get up too late so I'll just grab a banana and run out
of the door (very good) and then if it is raining, I always

00:00:30.790 --> 00:00:31.790
get the bus (yeah)

00:00:31.790 --> 00:00:35.610
but if the weather is alright, I'll walk - takes about 20 minutes.

00:00:35.610 --> 00:00:36.730
How about you?

00:00:36.730 --> 00:00:39.040
I always take the tube. Always?

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:42.920
It's so far. If I was to take the bus it would take too long.

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:52.000
What time do you go for lunch? About one o'clock usually. I think I  pretty much always have

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:53.000
lunch at one.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:53.920
That's very precise.

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:57.559
one until two, every day, exactly. That's good though, it breaks up the day a bit,

00:00:57.559 --> 00:01:03.719
doesn't it? It does. What about - when do
you finish work? About six o'clock most days,

00:01:03.719 --> 00:01:08.100
some days if I can escape a little bit earlier that happens occasionally - don't tell the boss -

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:11.860
No, absolutely - Never tell the boss - How about you?

00:01:11.860 --> 00:01:13.900
I usually finish at six actually.

00:01:13.900 --> 00:01:22.800
And then what do you do with your evenings? 
WIth my life? I go home and I rarely cook actually

00:01:22.800 --> 00:01:26.850
Noooo... I always cook. I love to cook dinner.

00:01:26.850 --> 00:01:32.140
Maybe once a week - rarely cook - sometimes eat
in a restaurant, sometimes eat with friends

00:01:32.140 --> 00:01:36.490
That's nice - Yeah, and then usually go to bed at about midnight.

00:01:36.490 --> 00:01:39.200
About midnight? Oh no, I'm in bed by ten o'clock. Really?

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:42.970
Yeah, otherwise I'm really grumpy in the
morning.

00:01:42.970 --> 00:01:45.080
Incredible - Well done you!

00:01:45.090 --> 00:01:45.820
Thanks!

